   "summary": "Prepared by SCAP's Civil Information and Education Section, this special report compiles statistical data and directory listings for all educational institutions in Fukuoka Prefecture for April and November 1946. It includes an analytical introduction describing Japanese educational administration, twelve summary tables breaking down institutions, enrollments, and faculties by level and control jurisdiction, and an extensive institutional roster. The roster lists school names, founding dates, locations, enrollment figures by gender, and faculty numbers across national, prefectural, and municipal jurisdictions down through municipal elementary schools.",
